#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/interfaces/topics/Understanding-ROS2-Topics/Understanding-ROS2-Topics.rst:563
msgid ""
"The command will return the bandwidth utilization and number of messages "
"being published to the ``/turtle1/pose`` topic."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/interfaces/topics/Understanding-ROS2-Topics/Understanding-ROS2-Topics.rst:566
msgid ""
"The bandwidth reflects the receiving rate on the subscription created by the "
"``ros2 topic bw`` command, which might be affected by platform resources and "
"QoS configuration, and may not exactly match the publisher's bandwidth."
